{
  "note": "Behavioral gate for the on-device tutor. Each case asserts on the device-EQUIVALENT path (base GGUF + adapter GGUF via llama-server) using the REAL runtime prompt (RagStore retrieval + generateSystemPrompt + grounding). Regexes are case-insensitive. expectRetrieves: a fact id the retriever MUST return ('none' = must return nothing). maxChars: response length ceiling (catches lecturing).",
